{"lines": [{"text": "Your streaming bill just went up again, and it is not an accident.", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.104, "spec": null, "words": [["Your", 0.08, 0.17], ["streaming", 0.17, 0.568], ["bill", 0.568, 0.909], ["just", 0.92, 1.102], ["went", 1.102, 1.205], ["up", 1.205, 1.307], ["again", 1.307, 1.693], ["and", 2.08, 2.159], ["it", 2.159, 2.216], ["is", 2.216, 2.295], ["not", 2.295, 2.58], ["an", 2.58, 2.625], ["accident", 2.625, 3.159]]}, {"text": "In 2025, US prices for video subscriptions rose about seven times faster than overall inflation.", "start": 4.354, "end": 11.074, "spec": null, "words": [["In 2025", 0.08, 1.068], ["US", 1.318, 1.761], ["prices", 1.761, 2.182], ["for", 2.182, 2.284], ["video", 2.295, 2.648], ["subscriptions", 2.648, 3.318], ["rose", 3.534, 3.841], ["about", 3.841, 4.045], ["seven", 4.045, 4.386], ["times", 4.386, 4.693], ["faster", 4.705, 5.284], ["than", 5.284, 5.455], ["overall", 5.466, 5.852], ["inflation", 5.864, 6.398]]}, {"text": "It starts with growth: about nine in ten US internet homes already pay for at least one service.", "start": 11.324, "end": 17.348, "spec": null, "words": [["It", 0.091, 0.136], ["starts", 0.136, 0.386], ["with", 0.398, 0.511], ["growth", 0.511, 1.023], ["about", 1.273, 1.534], ["nine", 1.545, 1.852], ["in", 1.852, 1.966], ["ten", 2.023, 2.25], ["US", 2.25, 2.591], ["internet", 2.591, 2.852], ["homes", 2.864, 3.352], ["already", 3.455, 3.739], ["pay", 3.739, 4.17], ["for", 4.364, 4.523], ["at", 4.534, 4.614], ["least", 4.614, 4.864], ["one", 4.864, 5.08], ["service", 5.08, 5.682]]}, {"text": "When almost everyone has signed up, new customers get hard to find.", "start": 17.598, "end": 21.102, "spec": null, "words": [["When", 0.091, 0.17], ["almost", 0.17, 0.432], ["everyone", 0.5, 0.795], ["has", 0.795, 0.909], ["signed", 0.909, 1.182], ["up", 1.182, 1.364], ["new", 1.602, 1.841], ["customers", 1.841, 2.364], ["get", 2.364, 2.489], ["hard", 2.489, 2.693], ["to", 2.705, 2.739], ["find", 2.75, 3.182]]}, {"text": "So the easiest way to grow is to charge the people already paying a little more.", "start": 21.352, "end": 25.552, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.216], ["the", 0.216, 0.295], ["easiest", 0.295, 0.75], ["way", 0.761, 0.864], ["to", 0.864, 0.92], ["grow", 0.92, 1.409], ["is", 1.5, 1.602], ["to", 1.614, 1.693], ["charge", 1.693, 2.159], ["the", 2.17, 2.25], ["people", 2.25, 2.545], ["already", 2.557, 2.852], ["paying", 2.852, 3.239], ["a", 3.239, 3.284], ["little", 3.295, 3.477], ["more", 3.489, 3.864]]}, {"text": "Meanwhile, the biggest services each spend well over ten billion dollars a year on shows and movies.", "start": 25.802, "end": 31.922, "spec": null, "words": [["Meanwhile", 0.08, 0.625], ["the", 0.989, 1.091], ["biggest", 1.102, 1.443], ["services", 1.443, 1.989], ["each", 2.125, 2.284], ["spend", 2.284, 2.67], ["well", 2.67, 2.932], ["over", 2.943, 3.182], ["ten", 3.193, 3.511], ["billion", 3.523, 3.886], ["dollars", 3.886, 4.159], ["a", 4.159, 4.182], ["year", 4.182, 4.545], ["on", 4.75, 4.841], ["shows", 4.841, 5.205], ["and", 5.205, 5.273], ["movies", 5.273, 5.784]]}, {"text": "Then came cheaper plans with ads, which earn money twice: from you and from advertisers.", "start": 32.172, "end": 37.788, "spec": null, "words": [["Then", 0.08, 0.409], ["came", 0.409, 0.67], ["cheaper", 0.682, 1.011], ["plans", 1.011, 1.341], ["with", 1.352, 1.477], ["ads", 1.477, 1.932], ["which", 2.17, 2.352], ["earn", 2.352, 2.489], ["money", 2.489, 2.716], ["twice", 2.716, 3.341], ["from", 3.568, 3.727], ["you", 3.727, 4.091], ["and", 4.273, 4.352], ["from", 4.352, 4.466], ["advertisers", 4.477, 5.284]]}, {"text": "The average ad-free plan went from about nine dollars in 2020 to about sixteen in 2025.", "start": 38.038, "end": 44.374, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.17], ["average", 0.17, 0.489], ["ad-free", 0.5, 0.898], ["plan", 0.898, 1.318], ["went", 1.557, 1.682], ["from", 1.693, 1.795], ["about", 1.795, 2.102], ["nine", 2.227, 2.557], ["dollars", 2.557, 2.898], ["in 2020", 2.909, 3.705], ["to", 3.864, 3.977], ["about", 3.977, 4.227], ["sixteen", 4.227, 4.955], ["in 2025", 5.011, 6.0]]}, {"text": "Then the sharing crackdown: one big service estimated over a hundred million homes were using borrowed passwords.", "start": 44.624, "end": 51.272, "spec": null, "words": [["Then", 0.091, 0.284], ["the", 0.284, 0.341], ["sharing", 0.352, 0.727], ["crackdown", 0.727, 1.318], ["one", 1.739, 1.955], ["big", 1.955, 2.182], ["service", 2.182, 2.614], ["estimated", 2.625, 3.17], ["over", 3.182, 3.398], ["a", 3.398, 3.432], ["hundred", 3.432, 3.864], ["million", 3.864, 4.295], ["homes", 4.307, 4.75], ["were", 4.75, 4.886], ["using", 4.886, 5.227], ["borrowed", 5.239, 5.568], ["passwords", 5.58, 6.318]]}, {"text": "Now those extra homes have to pay their own way, or the owner pays an extra fee.", "start": 51.522, "end": 56.37, "spec": null, "words": [["Now", 0.08, 0.273], ["those", 0.466, 0.693], ["extra", 0.705, 0.989], ["homes", 0.989, 1.409], ["have", 1.5, 1.636], ["to", 1.636, 1.716], ["pay", 1.716, 1.92], ["their", 1.92, 2.091], ["own", 2.091, 2.261], ["way", 2.261, 2.648], ["or", 3.057, 3.159], ["the", 3.159, 3.25], ["owner", 3.25, 3.523], ["pays", 3.534, 3.875], ["an", 3.875, 3.932], ["extra", 3.932, 4.193], ["fee", 4.193, 4.511]]}, {"text": "About four in ten people cancel a service within six months, and many sign up again later.", "start": 56.62, "end": 62.02, "spec": null, "words": [["About", 0.091, 0.318], ["four", 0.33, 0.67], ["in", 0.67, 0.841], ["ten", 0.943, 1.25], ["people", 1.25, 1.545], ["cancel", 1.557, 1.943], ["a", 1.943, 1.977], ["service", 1.977, 2.375], ["within", 2.375, 2.705], ["six", 2.716, 2.966], ["months", 2.977, 3.477], ["and", 3.705, 3.83], ["many", 3.841, 4.068], ["sign", 4.08, 4.375], ["up", 4.375, 4.489], ["again", 4.489, 4.739], ["later", 4.75, 5.057]]}, {"text": "Each price hike is a bet that most of you will grumble and stay.", "start": 62.27, "end": 65.702, "spec": null, "words": [["Each", 0.091, 0.216], ["price", 0.216, 0.477], ["hike", 0.477, 0.784], ["is", 0.909, 0.977], ["a", 0.977, 1.034], ["bet", 1.045, 1.284], ["that", 1.295, 1.477], ["most", 1.477, 1.852], ["of", 1.864, 1.898], ["you", 1.898, 2.0], ["will", 2.011, 2.102], ["grumble", 2.102, 2.523], ["and", 2.534, 2.602], ["stay", 2.614, 3.102]]}, {"text": "How many streaming services are you paying for right now?", "start": 65.952, "end": 68.736, "spec": null, "words": [["How", 0.102, 0.193], ["many", 0.205, 0.386], ["streaming", 0.398, 0.852], ["services", 0.864, 1.318], ["are", 1.33, 1.386], ["you", 1.386, 1.511], ["paying", 1.511, 1.83], ["for", 1.83, 1.966], ["right", 1.966, 2.136], ["now", 2.148, 2.455]]}], "dur": 70.54}